      tr(
        `Usage: yo build [steps...] [options]

Build the project described by build.yo (default step: install).

Options:
  --list-steps              Show the available build steps
  --list-options            Show the options this build file declares (-Dname=value)
  -j, --jobs <N>            Run up to N nodes of a DAG level at once (default 1)
  --summary                 Print the build summary tree
  --dry-run                 Resolve the build graph without running it
  --build-file <path>       Use an alternate build.yo
  --cc, --c-compiler <cc>   C compiler to use
  -t, --target <triple>     Cross-compile target
