        `Usage: yo test [path] [options]

Run *.test.yo files (a file, a directory tree, or the whole workspace).

Options:
  -b, --bail                Stop after the first failure
  -v, --verbose             Show detailed output and errors
  --test-name-pattern <s>   Run only tests whose name contains <s>
  --exclude <path>          Exclude a directory/file (repeatable)
  -p, --parallel <n>        Accepted for compatibility (v1 runs sequentially)
  --test-batch-size <n>     Tests per generated C batch (default 100)
  --cc, --c-compiler <cc>   C compiler for test binaries
