  $ yo check ./std --exclude std/libc`
      )
    ),
    (subcmd == "verify") => Option(String).Some(
      tr(
        `Usage: yo verify [path] [options]

Compile-time verification with the pinned Z3 solver (Dafny/SPARK model;
V2+V3 of plans/backlog/FORMAL_VERIFICATION.md). Every function in the
target set is symbolically executed and its proof obligations — callee
ensures, caller-side requires discharge, assert sites, and the automatic
bounds/div-by-zero/shift-width checks (AoRTE) — are proved or refuted
with concrete counter-examples. Non-zero exit on any failure.

The solver is resolved from YO_Z3_PATH, then the pinned install in
~/.cache/yo/solvers/, and is auto-downloaded from GitHub Releases when
neither exists.

Options:
  --verify-mode <mode>      runtime | verify | verify+ (default verify;
                            the file pragma is source of truth when present)
  --solver-path <path>      Use this z3 binary (overrides discovery)
  --rlimit <n>              Solver resource budget (default 5000000)
  --format <text|json>      Output format (default text)
  --explain <fn>            Print the full obligation detail for functions
                            whose id matches <fn> (substring)
  --no-cache                Skip the verification cache

Examples:
  $ yo verify ./src
  $ yo verify --solver-path /usr/bin/z3 --format json
  $ yo verify ./tests/spec/verify_straight_line.test.yo --explain abs`,
        `用法：yo verify [路径] [选项]

使用固定版本的 Z3 求解器做编译期验证（Dafny/SPARK 模型；
plans/backlog/FORMAL_VERIFICATION.md 的 V2+V3 阶段）。目标集合中的每个
函数都会被符号执行，其证明义务——被调方 ensures、调用方 requires 的
履行、assert 位点，以及自动的越界/除零/移位宽度检查（AoRTE）——都会
被证明，或带具体反例被驳倒。任何失败都以非零退出码结束。

求解器依次从 YO_Z3_PATH、~/.cache/yo/solvers/ 中的固定安装解析，
都不存在时自动从 GitHub Releases 下载。

选项：
  --verify-mode <模式>     runtime | verify | verify+（默认 verify；
                           文件内 pragma 存在时以 pragma 为准）
  --solver-path <路径>     使用指定的 z3 二进制（覆盖自动发现）
  --rlimit <n>             求解器资源预算（默认 5000000）
  --format <text|json>     输出格式（默认 text）
  --explain <函数名>       打印 id 匹配（子串）的函数的完整义务明细
  --no-cache               跳过验证缓存

示例：
  $ yo verify ./src
  $ yo verify --solver-path /usr/bin/z3 --format json
  $ yo verify ./tests/spec/verify_straight_line.test.yo --explain abs`
