        `Usage: yo remove <name> [options]

Delete a dependency from yo.toml and prune it from yo.lock.

Options:
  -v, --verbose              Show detailed progress

Example:
  $ yo remove raylib_yo`,
        `用法：yo remove <name> [options]

从 yo.toml 删除依赖并从 yo.lock 剪除。

选项：
  -v, --verbose              显示详细进度

示例：
  $ yo remove raylib_yo`
      )
    ),
    (subcmd == "install") => Option(String).Some(
      tr(
        `Usage: yo install [options]

Resolve the dependency graph yo.toml declares — every package's own
yo.toml is read too, and one ref per package must satisfy every
requirement on it — fetch the trees into the global cache and write
yo.lock. A lock entry that still satisfies its requirements is kept;
stale entries are pruned. \`yo build\` runs the same step for
dependencies the cache lacks.

Options:
  --locked                   Fail if yo.lock would change (CI)
  --offline                  Fail if the network would be needed
  --frozen                   --locked and --offline
  -v, --verbose              Show detailed fetch progress

Example:
  $ yo install`,
        `用法：yo install [options]

解析 yo.toml 声明的依赖图——每个包自己的 yo.toml 也会读取，每个包只选
一个同时满足所有需求的 ref——把源码树抓取到全局缓存并写入 yo.lock。
仍满足需求的锁条目保留；过期条目剪除。\`yo build\` 对缓存缺失的依赖执行同一步骤。

选项：
  --locked                   若 yo.lock 会改动则失败（CI）
  --offline                  若需要联网则失败
  --frozen                   同时 --locked 与 --offline
  -v, --verbose              显示详细的抓取进度

示例：
  $ yo install`
      )
    ),
    (subcmd == "update") => Option(String).Some(
      tr(
        `Usage: yo update [name...] [options]

Re-resolve dependencies within their requirements — the highest tag a
version range allows, the tip of a branch — and rewrite yo.lock. Names
limit the update to those dependencies. --latest also raises each
version range in yo.toml to the newest release (^X.Y.Z).

Options:
  --latest                   Bump version ranges to the newest release
  --offline                  Fail if the network would be needed
  -v, --verbose              Show detailed progress

Examples:
  $ yo update
  $ yo update raylib_yo
  $ yo update --latest`,
        `用法：yo update [name...] [options]

在需求范围内重新解析依赖——版本范围允许的最高标签、分支的最新提交——
并重写 yo.lock。给出名字则只更新这些依赖。--latest 还会把 yo.toml 中的
版本范围提升到最新发布版（^X.Y.Z）。

选项：
  --latest                   把版本范围提升到最新发布版
  --offline                  若需要联网则失败
  -v, --verbose              显示详细进度

示例：
  $ yo update
  $ yo update raylib_yo
  $ yo update --latest`
      )
    ),
    (subcmd == "cache") => Option(String).Some(
      tr(
        `Usage: yo cache <action>

Manage the global dependency store (~/.cache/yo: store/, git/, index/).

Actions:
  path                      Print the global cache directory
  clean                     Remove the dependency store (every package tree,
                            mirror and tag list); cached Yo versions are kept
  gc                        Remove the trees, mirrors and tag lists no recorded
                            project's yo.lock references

Examples:
  $ yo cache path
  $ yo cache clean
  $ yo cache gc`,
        `用法：yo cache <action>

管理全局依赖存储（~/.cache/yo：store/、git/、index/）。

动作：
  path                      打印全局缓存目录
  clean                     删除依赖存储（所有包树、镜像和标签列表）；已缓存的 Yo 版本保留
  gc                        删除没有任何已记录项目的 yo.lock 引用的包树、镜像和标签列表

示例：
  $ yo cache path
  $ yo cache clean
  $ yo cache gc`
      )
    ),
    (subcmd == "version") => Option(String).Some(
      tr(
        `Usage: yo version [action] [options]

Show or manage Yo toolchain versions. With no action, prints the current
version and the project's .yo-version pin (if any).

Actions:
  pin [version]             Pin the project to a version via .yo-version
                            (defaults to the current version; a named version
                            is validated against the published releases)
  install <version>         Pre-download a version into the version cache
  list                      List cached versions
  list --remote             List published releases (GitHub Releases);
                            marks (current) and (cached)
  clean [version]           Remove one cached version, or all of them

Options:
  --remote                  With 'list': query the published releases

Examples:
  $ yo version
  $ yo version pin 0.2.16
  $ yo version list --remote
  $ yo version install 0.2.16
  $ yo version clean 0.2.14`,
        `用法：yo version [action] [options]

查看或管理 Yo 工具链版本。不带动作时，打印当前版本和项目的
.yo-version 锁定（如有）。

动作：
  pin [version]             用 .yo-version 把项目锁定到某个版本
                            （默认锁定当前版本；指定版本时会对照已发布的
                            release 做校验）
  install <version>         预先把某个版本下载到版本缓存
  list                      列出已缓存的版本
  list --remote             列出已发布的 release（GitHub Releases）；
                            标注（current）和（cached）
  clean [version]           删除某个缓存版本，或全部删除

选项：
  --remote                  配合 'list'：查询已发布的 release

示例：
  $ yo version
  $ yo version pin 0.2.16
  $ yo version list --remote
  $ yo version install 0.2.16
  $ yo version clean 0.2.14`
      )
    ),
    (subcmd == "explain") => Option(String).Some(
      tr(
        `Usage: yo explain <CODE> [options]

Show the offline explanation for a diagnostic code (bilingual English +
简体中文), with a bad/good example pair. The registry ships inside the
binary — no network needed.

Options:
  --list                 List every code with its title
  --format json          One JSON object per entry (carries both languages)
  --lang zh-CN           Print the Chinese prose (default: en; YO_LANG env
                         var is equivalent)

Examples:
  $ yo explain E0401
  $ yo explain E0601 --lang zh-CN
  $ yo explain --list`,
        `用法：yo explain <CODE> [options]

离线显示某个诊断代码的解释（英语 + 简体中文双语），并附错误/正确
示例对。注册表内置于二进制中——无需网络。

选项：
  --list                 列出所有代码及其标题
  --format json          每个条目一行 JSON（同时携带两种语言）
  --lang zh-CN           输出中文解释（默认 en；等价于设置 YO_LANG
                         环境变量）

示例：
  $ yo explain E0401
  $ yo explain E0601 --lang zh-CN
  $ yo explain --list`
      )
    ),
    (subcmd == "lsp") => Option(String).Some(
      tr(
        `Usage: yo lsp

Run the Yo language server on stdio (diagnostics, hover, definition,
symbols, references, folding, rename, formatting, signature help,
completion). Used by editor clients such as the VS Code extension.`,
        `用法：yo lsp

在 stdio 上运行 Yo 语言服务器（诊断、悬停、定义、符号、引用、
折叠、重命名、格式化、签名帮助、补全）。供 VS Code 扩展等编辑器
客户端使用。`
      )
    ),
    (subcmd == "unsafe-report") => Option(String).Some(
